=== parameters ===
panel 2022-01-03 → 2023-02-24 n 300
LB_FULL 60 SKIP 5 → mom window ends at t-1-SKIP, starts t-1-SKIP-LB_FULL
dual_MA 10 30 vol_target 0.1 vol_lb 20
costs: P2 four-part stack 10 bps one-way + √impact × turnover
look-ahead: all positions use shift(1); mom uses only past returns
cite: Jegadeesh & Titman 1993 JF relative-strength J/K; 12-1 = skip recent month (industry practice)
cite: NYU Stern Dhar Trading Strategies syllabus — trend → counter-trend → pairs

