note: on THIS short synthetic panel no-skip can win — that does not refute the JT/industry motive:
  JT 1993 skip-a-week variants avoid bid-ask/short-term reversal; 12-1 skips recent month for the same reason.
  Expected-value framing: skip is a bias-reduction design choice, not a guarantee on every sample.
crowding/turnover: higher turnover erodes edge — compare dual turn vs ts turn above

